      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redis — dual use, same flag\nSettings.use_redis\n\n1) RateLimiter (INCR/EXPIRE)\n\n2) Checkpointer for both LangGraph graphs\n   (AsyncRedisSaver) — requires\n   redis-stack-server (RediSearch/\n   FT.*), redis:7-alpine does NOT work\n\nuse_redis=false (default) → everything\nin-process (MemorySaver)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 144.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redis — dual use, same flag\nSettings.use_redis\n\n1) RateLimiter (INCR/EXPIRE)\n\n2) Checkpointer for both LangGraph graphs\n   (AsyncRedisSaver) — requires\n   redis-stack-server (RediSearch/\n   FT.*), redis:7-alpine does NOT work\n\nuse_redis=false (default) → everything\nin-process (MemorySaver)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
