      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "reason (LLM + bind_tools)\n  → validate_tool_calls (deterministic: unknown\n    tool, identity in args, loan amount\n    out of range)\n  → execute_tool (the 5 StructuredTools)\n  → self_correct (structured error? injects\n    a correction and GOES BACK to reason — up to 2x)\n  → finalize\n\ncheckpoint per thread_id=telegram:<update_id>\n(crash recovery WITHIN a turn, not across turns)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 132.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "reason (LLM + bind_tools)\n  → validate_tool_calls (deterministic: unknown\n    tool, identity in args, loan amount\n    out of range)\n  → execute_tool (the 5 StructuredTools)\n  → self_correct (structured error? injects\n    a correction and GOES BACK to reason — up to 2x)\n  → finalize\n\ncheckpoint per thread_id=telegram:<update_id>\n(crash recovery WITHIN a turn, not across turns)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
