      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "assess → route_by_amount →\n  auto_approve → END          [status: approved]\n  await_decision → END        [PAUSE, checkpoint]\n\n2nd call (admin endpoint, days later):\naupdate_state(human_decision) + ainvoke(None)\n→ route_by_decision → finalize\n\ncheckpoint per thread_id=application_id\n(survives the wait for a human)\n\nno node calls an LLM",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 144.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "assess → route_by_amount →\n  auto_approve → END          [status: approved]\n  await_decision → END        [PAUSE, checkpoint]\n\n2nd call (admin endpoint, days later):\naupdate_state(human_decision) + ainvoke(None)\n→ route_by_decision → finalize\n\ncheckpoint per thread_id=application_id\n(survives the wait for a human)\n\nno node calls an LLM",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
